OL,3,GNEWSAMPs and MSP detained by Israel and
OL,4,Abarred from entering West Bank
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey had travelled to the region as
OL,7,Fpart of a Progressive International
OL,8,Fdelegation that also included ex-Labour
OL,9,FMP Sam Tarry and a former member of the
OL,10,FBasque senate.
